acceptance_criteria: "pm activity --from 7d and equivalent supported bare windows either resolve deterministically to the intended ago bound or fail with invalid_argument_value; no invalid relative can silently masquerade as an empty activity set; help/contracts document accepted grammar; CLI and SDK regression tests cover valid, bare, and invalid forms"
parent: pm-mpbb
risk: medium
confidence: 90
resolution: Unsigned duration windows are normalized as past-relative activity boundaries without changing signed or absolute inputs.
expected_result: pm activity --from 7d and --from 1w return activity within those past windows.
actual_result: Focused tests and packed acceptance return recent events for bare 7d while legacy inputs remain compatible.
